<title>JAPAN: Sanwa Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sanwa Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     1.26 trln	 vs	    1.55 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  153.92		vs	  287.01</p>
<p> Current	     54.03		vs	    32.5</p>
<p> Net		   54.67		vs	   15.78</p>
<p> EPS		   18.84 yen	  vs	    5.44 yen</p>
<p> Shares		 2.90 billion    vs	    2.90 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.25 yen	  vs	    4.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sanwa Bank Ltd is a major city bank.</p>
